==English==

===Etymology===
* A direct borrowing of the German term ''[[Kapellmeister]]''

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{music}} A leader or [[conductor]] of a musical group such as an [[orchestra]].
# {{music}} A term used during the [[baroque]] and [[classical|classical period]] for the person in charge of music at a noble [[court]].

====Synonyms====
* [[conductor]]
* [[bandmaster]]

